{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Backrooms: No Way Out is an immersive survival horror game featuring various famous backrooms levels, terrifying entities, and unique gameplay. Up to 4 players can join together to explore the dangerous levels and search for a way out.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3628360/extras/image.png?t=1743780999\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This game features realistic graphics and spatialized audio to create the best immersive experience, creating the feeling of truly being lost in the backrooms without a way out.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3628360/extras/1_-_Made_with_Clipchamp.gif?t=1743780999\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3628360/extras/imaage.png?t=1743780999\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Traverse the levels with a team of up to 4 players. Work together to escape each level and find the way out.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3628360/extras/2_-_Made_with_Clipchamp.gif?t=1743780999\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3628360/extras/s.png?t=1743780999\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each level was designed and created to be as immersive and enjoyable to play as possible.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3628360/extras/3_-_Made_with_Clipchamp.gif?t=1743780999\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3628360/extras/sda.png?t=1743780999\" /> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each level, entity, exit, and game mechanic has been designed to be as lore accurate as possible.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3628360/extras/4_-_Made_with_Clipchamp.gif?t=1743780999\" /></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3628360?t=1743780999","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3628360?t=1743780999","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3628360/76cd72b2fd7108d69e7decfaee3fd0a048eb8ed9/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1743780999","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3628360/76cd72b2fd7108d69e7decfaee3fd0a048eb8ed9/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1743780999","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Backrooms: No Way Out is an immersive survival horror game featuring various famous backrooms levels, terrifying entities, and unique gameplay. Up to 4 players can join together to explore the dangerous levels and search for a way out.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3628360/extras/image.png?t=1743780999\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This game features realistic graphics and spatialized audio to create the best immersive ex